      "Question": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "A start-up company with a limited budget is planning to adopt a hybrid cloud solution for their operations. The company has business-critical applications that serve customers and have strict service levels. In addition, the company has less critical applications such as backup and archive."
